.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
.PP
orbit-config-list - List all resolved configuration entries and their sources


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBorbit config list [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Displays all active configuration parameters across defaults, configuration file, environment variables, and flags.


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB-f\fP, \fB--format\fP="table"
	Output format: table, json, or yaml

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for list


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
.PP
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to configuration file


.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBorbit-config(1)\fP
